## 5. Getting Started

### Prerequisites

Ensure the following are installed:

- Python 3.9 or higher  
- Node.js & npm (for TypeScript scanner)  
- Podman or Docker  
- MySQL / PostgreSQL / Oracle (optional)

---

### Installation

#### 1. Clone the Repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/Suman-Sen/ML_Testing5.git
cd ML_Testing5

2. Setup Python Environment

python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate   # Linux/Mac
venv\Scripts\activate      # Windows
pip install -r requirements.txt

3. Database Setup

mysql -u root -p < schema_mysql.sql

4. Running the Backend

cd backend
uvicorn main:app --reload

4. Backend will be available at:

http://localhost:8000

5. Using the Classifiers
📄 Document Classification
POST /predict/document

Image Classification
POST /predict/image

PII Scanner
python pii_scanner/run.py

TypeScript Version
cd pii-scanner-ts
npm install
npm start

